{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And the favor of Him who dwelt in the bush.</b> Like 'who dwelt in the bush'; and may his land be blessed from the favor and good pleasure of the Holy One, blessed be He, who was first revealed to me at the bush." "<b>Favor.</b> Good pleasure and appeasement — and so every 'favor' in Scripture." "<b>Its produce.</b> This blessing: <b>for the head of Joseph.</b>" "<b>Nazarite of his brothers.</b> Who was set apart from his brothers in recognition (see Sifrei)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:49:45.489197052Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}